<view class="page {{role}} "><view wx:if="{{denied}}" class="denied">{{denied}}<button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view><block wx:else><view class="eyebrow">A LITTLE LUCK FOR YOU</view><view class="heading-title">确认参与</view><view class="subtitle">{{a.name}}</view><view class="card" style="margin-top:35rpx"><view class="card-title">选择领取方式</view><view class="option {{mode==='AUTO'?'selected':''}}" bindtap="selectMode" data-value="AUTO"><view class="option-title">✧ 自动配号</view><view class="option-desc">中奖后自动提交出票，稍后可在权益中查看结果。</view></view><view class="option {{mode==='MANUAL'?'selected':''}}" bindtap="selectMode" data-value="MANUAL"><view class="option-title">◇ 手动选号</view><view class="option-desc">中奖后预占权益，在有效期内完成模拟选号。</view></view></view><view class="note">每人限 {{a.perUserLimit}} 次；参与后未中奖也会消耗次数。中奖结果由 mock 服务层抽取，页面不指定结果。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="confirmClaim" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">确认参与</button></block></view>